{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/22/9117037/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、じっとしてても汗をかく\n気温になってきましたね〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し寝坊なんかした日には\n駅まで早歩きするだけで\n汗が噴き出してきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日朝の電車が涼しくて\n本当にオアシスです、、、！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏は余裕のある行動で\nなるべく汗をかかないようにしたい...!\n(但しLIVEは除く)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/22/9117037/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"太陽ノック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに！！！！！\n明日7/22は太陽ノックの発売日です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/22/9117037/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初選抜の曲が改めてCDになると\n本当に嬉しく思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん支えられてきたので、\nやっと恩返しが少しでも出来たかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂至上最高に盛り上がる夏曲に\nしたいと思っておりますので、\nたくさんの方の手に届きますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペアPVはゆっちゃんと〜〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/22/9117037/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらはtype-Bに入ってますので\nよろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"某メンバーに見られませんように(＞人＜;)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/22/9117037/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おに魂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はおに魂の生放送に出演させて\n頂きました〜〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2回目だったのですが、\n本当に楽しくて出演があっと言う間！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストツイツイにもたくさんお便り\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎度のことながら本当にたくさんあって\n感動しました(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子と出演出来て良かった〜〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっちゃんもおににゃんさんも\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/22/9117037/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの日はゆっちゃんの誕生日でも\nあったので、\n終わってからお祝いにも参加しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃっかりケーキも頂いて\n大満足でした〜〜(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また遊びに行きたいな〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/22/9117037/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【お知らせ】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TV"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎7/24 20:00〜 テレビ朝日\n「ミュージックステーション」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎7/25 21:00〜 スペースシャワーTVプラス\n「乃木坂46メンバーが選ぶライブ名曲\nセレクション」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎7/26 24:10〜 NHK 総合\n「MUSIC JAPAN」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎7/29 19:00〜 フジテレビ\n「2015 FNSうたの夏まつり」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎7/22 22:00〜 文化放送\n「レコメン！」 (23:00〜23:30頃)"},{